003600 FD  TKFL.
003700     COPY TOKUREC.
003800 FD  SHFL.
003900     COPY SHOREC.
004000 FD  URFL.
004100     COPY URIREC.
004200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004300 01  ZP-AREA.
004400     03  ZP-DATE                 PIC 9(08).
004500     03  ZP-KIN                  PIC S9(11)    COMP-3.
004600     03  ZP-KEIGEN               PIC X(01).
004700     03  ZP-HASU                 PIC X(01).
004800     03  ZP-RITU                 PIC 9(02).
004900     03  ZP-KBN                  PIC X(01).
005000     03  ZP-ZEI                  PIC S9(09)    COMP-3.
005100     03  ZP-RC                   PIC 9(02).
005200 01  W-TKEY                  PIC X(06).
005300 01  W-JKEY                  PIC X(06).
005400 01  W-SHN                   PIC 9(04)  VALUE ZERO.
005500 01  W-SHT.
005600     03  W-SH OCCURS 2000 INDEXED BY SX.
005700         05  W-SH-CD         PIC X(06).
005800         05  W-SH-KEIGEN     PIC X(01).
005900 01  N1                      PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006000 01  N2                      PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006100 01  N3                      PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
006300 A000.
006400     OPEN INPUT SHFL.
006500 A010.
006600     READ SHFL AT END GO TO A020.
006700     ADD 1 TO W-SHN.
006800     MOVE SH-CD      TO W-SH-CD (W-SHN).
006900     MOVE SH-ZEI-KBN TO W-SH-KEIGEN (W-SHN).
007000     GO TO A010.
007100 A020.
007200     CLOSE SHFL.
007300     OPEN INPUT  JUFL TKFL
007400          OUTPUT URFL.
007500     PERFORM R100 THRU R100-EXIT.
007600     PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT.
007700*
007800 A100.
007900     IF W-JKEY = HIGH-VALUE
008000        GO TO A900.
008100     IF W-TKEY < W-JKEY
008200        PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT
008300        GO TO A100.
008400     IF W-TKEY > W-JKEY
008500        ADD 1 TO N3
008600        GO TO A800.
008700*
008800     INITIALIZE UR-REC.
008900     MOVE JU-TK-CD TO UR-TK-CD.
009000     MOVE JU-DATE  TO UR-DATE.
009100     MOVE JU-NO    TO UR-JU-NO.
009200     MOVE JU-SH-CD TO UR-SH-CD.
009300     MOVE JU-KBN   TO UR-KBN.
009400     IF JU-KBN = '2'
009500        COMPUTE UR-SURYO = ZERO - JU-SURYO
009600     ELSE
009700        MOVE JU-SURYO TO UR-SURYO.
009800     MOVE JU-TANKA TO UR-TANKA.
009900     COMPUTE URIAGE-KIN = UR-SURYO * UR-TANKA.
010000*    COMPUTE UR-ZEI-KIN = URIAGE-KIN * 3 / 100.
010100* 1997.02 改修 鈴木
010200     MOVE UR-DATE    TO ZP-DATE.
010300     MOVE URIAGE-KIN TO ZP-KIN.
010400     MOVE TK-HASU    TO ZP-HASU.
010500* 2019.08 改修 佐藤
010600     MOVE SPACE      TO ZP-KEIGEN.
010700     SET SX TO 1.
010800     SEARCH W-SH
010900         AT END MOVE SPACE TO ZP-KEIGEN
011000         WHEN W-SH-CD (SX) = UR-SH-CD
011100              MOVE W-SH-KEIGEN (SX) TO ZP-KEIGEN.
011200     CALL 'USB110' USING ZP-AREA.
011300     MOVE ZP-KBN     TO ZEI-KBN.
011400     MOVE ZP-RITU    TO UR-ZEI-RITU.
011500     MOVE ZP-ZEI     TO UR-ZEI-KIN.
011600     WRITE UR-REC.
011700     ADD 1 TO N2.
011800 A800.
011900     PERFORM R100 THRU R100-EXIT.
012000     GO TO A100.
012100*
012200 A900.
012300     CLOSE JUFL TKFL URFL.
012400     DISPLAY 'USB100 IN=' N1 ' OUT=' N2 ' NOTK=' N3.
012500     STOP RUN.
012600*
012700 R100.
012800     READ JUFL
012900         AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUE TO W-JKEY
013000                GO TO R100-EXIT.
013100     ADD 1 TO N1.
013200     MOVE JU-TK-CD TO W-JKEY.
013300 R100-EXIT.
013400     EXIT.
013500*
013600 R200.
013700     READ TKFL
013800         AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUE TO W-TKEY
013900                GO TO R200-EXIT.
014000     MOVE TK-CD TO W-TKEY.
014100 R200-EXIT.
014200     EXIT.
